{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06567","headline":"田家杂兴八首 三 · 储光羲","name":"田家杂兴八首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"逍遥阡陌上，远近无相识。\n落日照秋山，千岩同一色。\n网罟绕深莽，鹰鸇始轻翼。\n猎马既如风，奔兽莫敢息。\n驻旗沧海上，犒士吴宫侧。\n楚国有夫人，性情本贞直。\n鲜禽徒自致，终岁竟不食。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06567.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06567","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}